## 4. Stage 3 — `SaveTriggeredConsumerDataImpl` (substitution + intermediate write)

```java
public void saveConsumerData(ChunkMessage cm,
                              Map<Integer, List<FiredTriggerResult>> firedTriggerMap,
                              Map<Integer, List<IndicBaseDto>> fidMap) throws TucException {

    Object fileHandle = null;
    String lineSeparator = System.lineSeparator();

    AccountFieldLayout accountFieldLayout = AccountFieldLayout.getAccountFieldLayout(cm.getCompany());
    int fieldLengthRp3 = accountFieldLayout.getLength();
    PanDecryptService decryptService = PanDecryptServiceHolder.getInstance();
    boolean vaultEnabled = (decryptService != null) && decryptService.isEnabled();

    // job-wide INDEX-scope key, read from the message Stage 3's dispatch step set
    String keyLocation = vaultEnabled ? cm.getKeyLocation() : null;

    String txtPath = dirHelper.getAbsoluteFullfillName(cm);

    try {
        if (firedTriggerMap == null) {
            log.info("no triggers fired for chunk [{}]", cm.getChunkId());
            return;
        }
        fileHandle = fileio.openOutput(txtPath);

        for (Integer cfid : firedTriggerMap.keySet()) {
            List<IndicBaseDto> dtos = fidMap.get(cfid);
            List<FiredTriggerResult> results = firedTriggerMap.get(cfid);

            StringBuilder stuff = new StringBuilder();
            String scfid = cfid.toString();
            stuff.append(scfid).append("||A0").append(lineSeparator);

            TriggeredResultWrapper trw = new TriggeredResultWrapper();
            for (FiredTriggerResult result : results) {
                String block = trw.toString(scfid, result);
                if (keyLocation != null && block.contains("|AC|")) {
                    block = PanRestorationHelper.substituteAcLinesInBlock(block, keyLocation, fieldLengthRp3);
                }
                stuff.append(block);
            }

            for (IndicBaseDto dto : dtos) {
                String line = scfid + "|" + dto.toString();
                if (keyLocation != null) {
                    line = PanRestorationHelper.substituteAcctNumInRow(line, keyLocation, fieldLengthRp3);
                }
                stuff.append(line).append(lineSeparator);
            }

            stuff.append(scfid).append("||ZZ").append(lineSeparator);
            fileio.writePerson(fileHandle, stuff.toString());
        }

    } catch (Exception e) {
        log.error(e.getMessage(), e);
        throw new TucException("failed writing fulfill file for chunk [" + cm.getChunkId() + "]", e);
    } finally {
        if (fileHandle != null) {
            try { fileio.close(fileHandle); }
            catch (Exception ce) { log.error("error closing fulfill temp file", ce); }
        }
    }

    if (keyLocation != null) {
        try {
            writeIntermediateEncPanCsv(txtPath, keyLocation, accountFieldLayout, decryptService, cm);
        } catch (Exception e) {
            log.error("intermediate EncPan CSV failed for chunk [{}], continuing without it - "
                + "Stage 5 cold-cache recovery will handle", cm.getChunkId(), e);
        }
    }
}

/**
 * Write this chunk's intermediate .txt.EncPan.csv. Encrypted under a FRESH,
 * per-file vaultKeyLocation - distinct from keyLocation (which stays job-wide
 * and only scopes the INDEX counter). Every chunk in the job gets its own
 * unique vaultKeyLocation here.
 */
private void writeIntermediateEncPanCsv(String txtPath, String keyLocation, AccountFieldLayout outputLayout,
                                         PanDecryptService decryptService, ChunkMessage cm) throws TucException {
    Map<String, String> plainPanMap = PanSubstitutionService.buildPlainPanMapForOutput(keyLocation);
    if (plainPanMap.isEmpty()) {
        log.debug("no PAN entries for chunk [{}], skipping .txt.EncPan.csv", cm.getChunkId());
        return;
    }

    String vaultKeyLocation = PanSubstitutionService.generateKeyLocation();   // fresh, per-file
    Map<String, String> ciphertextMap = PanSubstitutionService.buildOutputCiphertextMap(
        keyLocation, plainPanMap, vaultKeyLocation, decryptService);

    String csvPath = txtPath + ".EncPan.csv";
    String csvTmp = csvPath + ".tmp";
    EncPanCsvWriter.write(csvTmp, vaultKeyLocation, ciphertextMap, outputLayout);
    promote(csvTmp, csvPath);
}
```

**Output:** `<chunk>.txt` (INDEX only) + `<chunk>.txt.EncPan.csv` (header carries this
chunk's own unique `vaultKeyLocation`, rows are `INDEX, ENC(ciphertext)` under that key).

